          "distinct": true,
          "id": "3ba43d2d1932f16de59b6e2ef4982f341d6a3d42",
          "message": "fix(velvet)!: describe a spring by its duration and bounce, make a zero-duration spring instant, and continue interrupted plays from the values drawn (#1416)\n\n## What & why\n\nRefs #1114 (item M11: \"`DurationSec` is ignored for springs\"). The issue lists many other unchecked items, so this does not close it.\n\n- A `Spring` that sets none of `Stiffness`, `Damping` and `Mass` takes its physics from `DurationSec` and the new `StyleTransitionConfig.Bounce`, as Framer Motion's spring `duration` / `bounce` do; each pass lands on its target once the duration has passed (`layoutId` moves, the `When = BeforeChildren` wait and sequence `To` steps included).\n- A channel released with a velocity solves its stiffness and damping for that velocity, as Framer's `findSpring` does per value.\n- A `DurationSec` of exactly 0 makes any spring instant (after its delay and stagger); `V.AnimatePresence` keeps the child until the exit has landed and removes it on the render after.\n- An enter or label change interrupting a running Spring or Bezier play starts each shared channel from the value drawn, with the velocity for a spring.\n\nMerged with main: this keeps the branch's spring/bezier hand-off through `Drawn` / `ContinueFrom` and adds main's native-transition rate after it. The bezier slope main computed in `VelocityOf` and the branch's `Drawn` were the same measurement, so `Drawn` now reads `VelocityOf` and `MotionSpringDriver.InheritVelocity(spring, bezier)` is gone. Main's case for it reads the same slope through `ContinueFrom`.\n\n## Breaking changes\n\n`Changelog~/breaking/fix-1114-spring-duration-ported.md`: a spring's `DurationSec` was ignored and now describes the spring when no physics knob is set; a zero-duration spring with any physics used to play on its physics and is now instant; interrupted plays start from the drawn values. `Changelog~/unreleased/fix-1114-spring-duration-ported.md` carries the new `Bounce`.\n\n## Docs\n\n`Documentation~/motion.md` updated.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01FoK7YxdRjMGmfmRkEEmS88)_",
