          "distinct": true,
          "id": "193ad8172b2c3f4623493038e7c26d1302e4ddbd",
          "message": "fix(velvet)!: rank play, gesture and exit classes as Framer Motion and the CSS cascade do, and let a V.Motion draw shadow, skew and dashed borders (#1442)\n\nRefs #1118\n\n## What changed\n\n**Class ranking**\n- A play's classes (enter, variant change, `animate`) rank like a CSS animation, above the plain classes.\n- Gesture classes (`while*Class`, `whileDraggingClass`) outrank a play, and an exit outranks both. This follows Framer Motion's `animate < while* < exit`.\n- When a gesture ends mid-play, the channel leaves the hover value and returns towards the play, instead of snapping.\n- A play applies every utility its class carries. On a field control this includes the box-surface, clip and text-overflow utilities.\n- A border colour animates side by side.\n- A BeforeChildren span counts only the channels that play.\n\n**Face painting**\n- A `V.Motion` now draws `shadow-*`, `skew-*` and dashed or dotted borders.\n- The face these layers repaint reads the element's own matched stylesheet rules, so id and type selectors, variants and theme classes colour it.\n- A Motion colour play shows on that face.\n- A shadowed element draws `border-dashed` / `border-dotted` and a `divide-dashed` child's dashes.\n- A shadowed element that clips keeps its border.\n- Skew draws its border sheared in its line style.\n\n**layoutId moves**\n- During a layoutId move under an uneven scale, the shadow, the dashed outline and the skew gradient follow the per-axis corners.\n- The shadow corners are round again when the move lands.\n- A skew's seat composes with the child's own translate, including during a layoutId move.\n\n**Still open**\n- A skewed element that clips loses its border.\n- A clipped, shadowed dashed border draws solid.\n- Both are documented in `styling-variants.md`.\n\n## Docs\n\n`motion.md`, `styling-variants.md`, `drag-and-drop.md` and `styling-backgrounds.md` are updated. The breaking changelog fragment is `Changelog~/breaking/fix-1118-play-class-precedence-6.md`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01FoK7YxdRjMGmfmRkEEmS88)_",
