          "id": "96e2035243f71ea843c64cb18b847d5e5814ac4e",
          "message": "fix(velvet)!: close styling-variant gaps against Tailwind and CSS (#1458)\n\nRefs #1117\n\nCloses the open items of the styling-variant gap list: imperative container markers, `[&>*]:` on composites, `[&>*]:` paints at mount, radius fit of rule- and code-written radii, and the assume-gated parse and scope-width cases.\n\nDocumentation: `styling-variants.md` updated for each behaviour change. CHANGELOG fragments added under `unreleased` and `breaking`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01FoK7YxdRjMGmfmRkEEmS88)_",
