          "distinct": true,
          "id": "cd6e67586da9b5ff869b6c1f49808b50707c0318",
          "message": "fix(velvet)!: Framer Motion parity for variant orchestration (#1455)\n\nCloses #1114\n\n## What & why\n- `TransitionWhen.AfterChildren` delays a Motion's own play until its variant children's plays end (label swaps, mount enters, presence enters and exits). Previously it warned and played as `Together`.\n- `StyleTransitionConfig.StaggerDirection` reverses the stagger for any value other than 1.\n- A Motion with variants that names no `initial` enters from its classes without the variant; `V.Motion(enterOnMount: false)` mounts at the resting pose.\n- A `clip-path-*` class on a Motion wraps it in the stencil container, as it does an element.\n- `whileHover` outranks `whileFocus`.\n- A variant play with no transition of its own runs each value on the default transition its type has: a spring for translate, rotate and skew, a stiffer one for scale, and a 0.3 s ease for opacity, colours and lengths.\n- `skew-*` angles animate through enters, swaps and exits.\n- A `PopLayout` ghost paints over the siblings that reflow into its rect.\n\nBreaking changes: `Changelog~/breaking/fix-1114*.md`. Docs updated alongside.\n\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Tests pass locally (EditMode / PlayMode / generator tests as applicable) — not run locally (no Unity editor available); the EditMode/PlayMode suites run in CI on this head\n- [ ] New regression tests were verified red without the change and green with it — measured by `Test ▸ base-red` on the merge base, pending on this head\n- [x] Docs are updated for every fact this change touches (guides, READMEs, CLAUDE.md) — or this PR has no doc impact\n- [x] CHANGELOG fragment added for behavior/perf changes, named for the branch with `/` as `-` — inline under `## [Unreleased]` on a maintenance line with no `scripts/release/compile_changelog.py` (pure refactors are omitted by convention)\n- [x] Known gaps or deliberate deferrals discovered here are filed as issues with acceptance criteria — none deferred\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01FoK7YxdRjMGmfmRkEEmS88\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
