          "distinct": true,
          "id": "d05257467b71477298090d45f1bf2506e5c62780",
          "message": "test(velvet): answer the mutation survivors in the editor preview window, bridge and inspect overlay (#1480)\n\n## What & why\n\nThe mutation record holds 41 survivors in `Editor/Preview/`: 17 in `PreviewPanelBridge.cs`, 15 in `VelvetPreviewWindow.cs` and 9 in `PreviewInspectOverlay.cs`. Each is answered by a test; no declaration is added.\n\n- **`PreviewPanelBridge`:**\n  - Forwarding of wheel, navigation move and submit, pointer focus, capture and release.\n  - `focusable`, and propagation stopping.\n  - Position mapping with no panel and with a collapsed canvas.\n- **`PreviewInspectOverlay`:**\n  - Pointer-leave and detach teardown, and the in-story check.\n  - The measure label's text and its position against the margin box, with the right edge read from the rendered texture.\n- **`VelvetPreviewWindow`:**\n  - The panel tick: rebuilding a destroyed panel, re-showing the texture, and repainting the overlay.\n  - Point filtering, and keeping a chosen panel-settings scale mode.\n  - Canvas sizing for stories that give only one dimension.\n  - Disposing panels on close and on a settings change.\n\nThe new cases pin behaviour main already has, so each carries a `GREEN_ON_BASE(characterization)` declaration. The next mutation record run decides the kills.\n\nTest-only; no doc or changelog impact.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests pass locally (EditMode / PlayMode / generator tests as applicable) — Unity suites run in CI\n- [x] New regression tests were verified red without the change and green with it — kills are decided by the next mutation record run\n- [x] Docs are updated for every fact this change touches (guides, READMEs, CLAUDE.md) — or this PR has no doc impact\n- [x] CHANGELOG fragment added for behavior/perf changes, named for the branch with `/` as `-` — inline under `## [Unreleased]` on a maintenance line with no `scripts/release/compile_changelog.py` (pure refactors are omitted by convention)\n- [x] Known gaps or deliberate deferrals discovered here are filed as issues with acceptance criteria\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01FoK7YxdRjMGmfmRkEEmS88)_",
