          "id": "b27bc1e8c07175634904dc68052ddb0cd6c86c84",
          "message": "test(velvet): answer the weaver survivors in CodeGen (#1495)\n\nNo issue: follow-up to the unanswered survivors of the mutation run over the weaver.\n\n## What & why\n\nThe mutation run over the weaver left 103 unanswered survivors under `Packages/com.velvet.core/CodeGen/`. This answers each one.\n\n- 84 are killed by 71 new cases in `Runtime/Hooks/Tests/Editor/ReactiveScope*Tests.cs`, which read the `MemoizationReportAttribute` the weaver leaves, inspect the emitted IL, mount woven components with call counters, or weave hand-built IL modules for shapes the C# compiler does not write. Each case is a `GREEN_ON_BASE(characterization)` naming the cut that reddens it.\n- 19 carry a `MUTANT_SURVIVES` declaration: 14 equivalent, 5 unreachable. Each reason was checked against the code that reaches the line. Three pin cases (container hooks, closure classes, `leave` with a value on the stack) hold the facts those declarations rest on.\n- No weaver defect turned up.\n\nMeasurement: the real CodeGen sources, a stub Velvet and the new test file were compiled outside Unity and woven in memory, Debug and Release, with in-process NUnit. All 71 cases pass on the unmutated sources in both configurations (142 runs). Every one of the 84 kills was measured in Debug; two (shapes the Release compiler writes differently) are Debug-only. The 19 declared lines still survive, as declared. Each case was also re-run with the arrangement perturbed so it stops distinguishing base from mutant (68 specs, all as expected). The Unity EditMode suite was not run locally; CI runs it and `Test ▸ base-red` runs the characterization cases on the merge base.\n\nOne line in `UnkeyedRowSuppressions.cs` suppresses the unkeyed-rows analyzer for a test that builds a label per loop iteration.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Tests pass locally (EditMode / PlayMode / generator tests as applicable) -- not run in Unity locally; out-of-Unity harness only, CI to confirm\n- [x] New regression tests were verified red without the change and green with it -- each kill measured against its mutant in the harness\n- [x] Docs are updated for every fact this change touches -- no doc impact (tests and comments only)\n- [x] CHANGELOG fragment -- not needed, no behaviour change\n- [x] Known gaps or deliberate deferrals -- none\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01FoK7YxdRjMGmfmRkEEmS88)_",
